{title: Patola}
{artist: Blackmail Guru Randhawa}
{key: D#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[D#m] Chadhdi jawaani [A#m] tera,        [C#] Gora gora rang [D#m] ni
[D#m] Gora gora rang [A#m] kare,        [C#] Mundeya nu tang [A#m] ni
Gore [D#m] hathan vich,        ni gore [A#m] hathan vich
Gore [C#] hathan vich,        lal chuda [A#m] chhanke
Ni mundeya di [D#m] jaan te bane,        Jadon [B] nikle, haye ni jadon [D#m] nikle
Jadon [C#] nikle patola [A#m] ban ke,        Ni mundeya di [D#m] jaan te bane
Jadon [C#] nikle patola [A#m] ban ke,        Ni mundeya di [D#m] jaan te bane
[D#m] Kaala suit kaala [A#m] til,        [C#] mukhde te [D#m] jachda
[D#m] Ve nazar na lage [A#m] tainu,        [C#] Bacha ke baby rakh [A#m] daan
Ishaare [D#m] karde, ishaare [A#m] karde,        Ishaare [C#] karde ni munde dar [A#m] dar ke
Mundeya di [D#m] jaan te bane,        Jadon [B] nikle, haye ni jadon [D#m] nikle
Jadon [C#] nikle patola [A#m] ban ke,        Ni mundeya di [D#m] jaan te bane
[D#m] Akhaan hi akhaan ch pyar,        [A#m] tere naal pa leya
[D#m] Gallan gallan vich tainu,        [C#] apni bana leya
[D#m] Supne de vich haaye mai,        [A#m] viah karwa leya
[C#] Haan karwa leya, viah karwa leya,        Roz [D#m] piche piche ni roz [A#m] piche piche
Daily [C#] piche piche aawaan chal [A#m] chal ke,        Mundeya di [D#m] jaan te bane
Jadon [B] nikle, haye ni jadon [D#m] nikle,        Jadon [C#] nikle patola [A#m] ban ke
Ni mundeya di [D#m] jaan te bane
